1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:04,049
If you only have one mirror, you have a signal you can see for miles.

2
00:00:04,649 --> 00:00:08,726
The Signal. Part two of four. The mirror.

3
00:00:09,326 --> 00:00:14,156
Eighty years old. This compact has never lied about my age.

4
00:00:14,756 --> 00:00:20,956
Make a V with your fingers. Aim the flash into the V. Three flashes mean help.

5
00:00:21,556 --> 00:00:22,476
Am I doing it right?

6
00:00:22,776 --> 00:00:24,448
You are blinding the pigeons.

7
00:00:26,416 --> 00:00:30,910
A mirror flash can be seen from fifteen kilometers or more on a sunny day.

8
00:00:31,510 --> 00:00:32,689
Cloud is coming.

9
00:00:32,989 --> 00:00:34,092
Then we signal now.

10
00:00:35,830 --> 00:00:38,731
Flash. Flash. Flash.

11
00:00:39,331 --> 00:00:42,576
Nothing. Only wind. Hours of nothing.

12
00:00:43,176 --> 00:00:45,029
Wait. Something flashed back!

13
00:00:46,596 --> 00:00:52,543
Part two of four, The Signal. Next: three fires.
